rown dogs added to the background. A wall is placed in front of the dogs, and the perspective has been altered to a distance angle, giving the impression of a wider, more expansive view of the scene.', 'The scene now features a larger wolf facing the camera, with vibrant red flowers blooming behind it. The wolf retains its breed but is closer to the viewer, and brown leaves are scattered around its base, enhancing the natural setting.', 'The final scene features two white plastic cups from Starbucks, with one cup filled with hot chocolate and the other empty. The angle of the shot has been changed to a side view, and a window has been added in the background, showing a view of the outside.', 'The coral has been transformed to a more vibrant orange hue, enhancing its flower-like appearance. The background has been changed to a brown, underwater setting, giving the scene a more immersive and natural look.', "The mug's handle is now black, contrasting with the white body of the mug, and the background has been changed to a solid gray, creating a more monochromatic and modern look.", 'The dog is now facing to the right, with a slightly more pronounced white coat. There are two additional white dogs of the same breed, standing close to the original dog. The ground is covered with green grass, contrasting with the brown dirt in the original scene.', 'The final scene shows a jar filled with a chocolate dessert, featuring layers of whipped cream and chocolate chips, presented in white and brown tones. The background has been changed to a clear, neutral setting, removing the brown background.', 'The mug now has a simple handle and is painted a light blue color.']
