ged to a diagonal view, and an adult figure has been added to the scene, with more vending machines visible in the background.', "The scene now shows two puppies, previously sitting, now feeding on an adult dog, with the adult dog's breed changed to a yellow-colored animal. The camera angle has been adjusted to an upper perspective, and a bed has been added under the dogs, providing a cozy setting for the meal.", 'The scene now depicts a home kitchen with no one in it, focusing on the sink area with white cabinets and black countertops. The chef is no longer present, and the background has been changed to a more domestic setting with typical kitchen appliances and utensils.']
