ed to a further angle, providing a broader view of the serene outdoor setting.', "The final scene shows a close-up of the sleeping dog's face and neck, with the dog's eyes closed and its head resting on the carpet. The dog's collar has been changed to a different color, though the specific color is not detailed in the instructions.", 'The Target Image shows a top-down view of a self-serve baked potato display with each condiment separated into its own dish, including sour cream, chives, and cheese, all neatly arranged in white bowls. The background is a stark black, emphasizing the food items, and the scene is viewed from above, providing a clear and organized layout.', 'The scene now features a white dog standing with men in black robes, replacing the original people. The white tent has been removed, and a dog is added to the foreground. A new building is visible in the background, altering the setting.', 'The scene now features a single guinea pig eating from the front a little to the left, with its breed matching the other guinea pig. Additionally, there is grass added under the guinea pig, enhancing the environment.', 'The scene now shows one hand wearing a gray glove with a panda face design, while the other hand is in a white glove with a panda face, both with protective accessories. The background has been changed to white.', 'In the final scene, a person is holding three puppies in their arms, with the focus on the dogs and a person wearing a grey shirt in the background. The puppies are nestled closely together in a bowl, and the person holding them appears to be gently cradling them.', 'The puppy is now lying in a sleeping posture on a white plain background, with a close-up view that emphasizes its soft fur and peaceful expression.', 'The final scene features a mug with triangle leaf patterns and a purple handle that curls to a point, facing to the right. The mug is set against a darker background with a shadow cast underneath, giving it a more dramatic and focused appearance.', 'The final scene shows a larger dog with black and white fur lying comfortably in an armchair, with a curtain at the back. The background has been changed to a longer shot, and the brick wall has been removed.']
