n lamps. The angle of the shot is slightly different, offering a broader view of the room.', 'The scene now features a wooden table with different sizes of dumbbells placed on it, replacing the Christmas-themed mat. The background has been changed to a clear sky, and the flowers in the vase have been removed.', 'The entire wall made of glass is now yellow, and the floor has been changed to a vibrant yellow, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. The background wall, which was previously black, has been transformed into a bright yellow, complementing the new floor color and adding a cheerful touch to the space.', 'The glass test tubes, each containing a distinct colored liquid, are arranged in a neat row, with the blue liquid in the smallest tube on the left and the green liquid in the largest tube on the right. The background has been changed to a clean white, making the vibrant colors of the liquids stand out more prominently.', 'The scene now features pandas among the trees, with a wooden bridge spanning across the area. The background no longer shows water, replaced by a clear sky and additional greenery.', 'The final scene shows a close-up of a gray Razer laptop with a vibrant rainbow screen, viewed from a narrowed perspective. The background is completely removed, leaving only the laptop in focus against a neutral gray backdrop.', 'The scene now depicts two people toasting in a restaurant, with a table set for a meal featuring plates, cups, and food. The setting includes fancy chairs and a colored window in the background, with the camera angle shifted to a side view, providing a broader perspective of the dining area.', 'The scene now features a caramel-colored dog wearing a black and white suit, standing in a front angle shot against a white background.']
