previously blue fish. The anemone has been changed to a pure white, and a small orange fish has been added to the scene. The background has been enriched with additional anemones, creating a more diverse and lively coral reef setting.', 'The Target Image now shows a side angle of a repurposed bookshelf with sliding doors, painted in a light teal color, with numbered compartments labeled 11 through 14. The scene is set in a room with a black door knob added to the sliding doors, and the background has been changed to a clear sky.', "The red glove is now shown with a metal lock featuring orange polka dots positioned above it. The green object on the ground has been removed, and the image has been zoomed in for a close-up view. A white and red sheet is added to the background, enhancing the scene's visual context."]
