nd easier to read.', "The aquarium now features only one glowing jellyfish, with its body illuminated in orange and yellow hues, making it the focal point of the scene. The background has been changed to a deep, dark blue, enhancing the jellyfish's vibrant colors and creating a more dramatic underwater atmosphere.", 'The scene now depicts a larger group of horses and dogs outside an old-fashioned home, with both big and small animals present. The horses and dogs are standing, and the setting has been expanded to include the home in the background.', 'The scene now shows multiple boklanes standing in a line on the road, with some boklanes placed in another location. There are people added to the photo, and the boklanes are positioned further away from the camera. A building has been added in the background, altering the setting.', 'The scene now shows a woman with a white apron holding up a dessert in a restaurant, with a table, two ketchup bottles, a salt shaker, and a napkin container added to the foreground. The camera angle has been changed to a distance shot, revealing a bustling restaurant filled with people in the background.', 'The image now shows only the larger guinea pig, with the smaller one removed. The ground is covered in snow, and a black and white tree trunk is visible in the background. The perspective is a front angle, focusing on the guinea pig.', "The left side of the room now features glass walls, offering an interior view of the room. The chair has been changed to a grey color, and the room's overall color has been altered to a grey tone.", 'The golf balls are arranged in a triangular formation, with each color distinctly labeled, and the background has been changed to a fake grass setting, creating a vibrant and playful scene.', 'The final scene shows a single, clear plastic water bottle with its straw standing upright. The bottle has no lettering on it, and the lid is black. The background is a plain white.']
