Gnerating descriptions:  60%|██████    | 157/260 [38:59<25:26, 14.82s/it]Gnerating descriptions:  61%|██████    | 158/260 [39:14<25:05, 14.76s/it]['The final scene shows a gray pillow with pearl designs instead of being made with woolen thread, and it is now accompanied by bedding accessories. Additionally, a white bed railing has been added to the scene.', 'In the final scene, two vultures are perched on the fallen carcass amidst a lush green grassy field, viewed from a distance, giving a broader perspective of the landscape.', 'The final scene shows a blue-colored knee cap instead of the black hand cap in the original image. The product has been changed to blue, and the image now includes a different angle of the product, providing a clearer view of its design and features.', 'The scene now features a dog sled with people facing forward, set against a backdrop of a yellow helicopter. The people are positioned in the same direction as before, and the image has been zoomed out to include snowy mountains in the distance, with numerous dogs pulling the sled.', 'The scene now shows a family of four canoing in a natural body of water, with the water in the background and the sky visible above. The perspective is from an upper angle, providing a clear view of the canoe and the surrounding water.', 'The final scene shows a single, colorful pink and blue flowery design carry case with storage accessories inside, replacing the original carry cases.', 'The modified scene shows a horizontal open kit with the zip open, containing the same assortment of stationery items as before. The case has been changed to a blue color, maintaining the same layout and organization of the items inside.', "The image now shows a whole chicken on a black plate, with the chicken's color changed to white. The scene is a close-up, and the background has been changed to white.", 'The final scene shows a pyramid of colorful golf balls with vibrant hues of green, red, and blue, arranged against a black background, with no black background effect visible on the balls.', "The scene shifts to a side angle, showcasing the store's interior with a brick white wall in the background. The shelves now hold a variety of baked goods, including bread and pastries, with some books added to the shelves and tables. The window in the background provides a view of the street outside, contrasting with the cozy, warm interior of the bakery.", 'The final scene shows a single puppy sitting on a grassy field, with a hand holding a small dog in the foreground, more focused on the puppy. The background is blurred, emphasizing the puppy and the hand holding the dog.', "The scene now features two people riding a boat, with the animals removed from the grassy hillside. The camera is zoomed in closer to the people and the boat, and the background has been changed to include more trees and rocks near the water's edge.", 'The scene now features a single vulture with white legs perched on a log in a field, with the same breed of vultures in the background. The image has been zoomed in for a closer shot, and greenery has been added to the background, enhancing the natural setting.', 'The scene now features only one boat, a vibrant orange kayak, positioned prominently in the foreground. The river flows gently in the background, with lush trees and dense vegetation framing the area, creating a serene and natural setting.', 'The scene now features a closer view of the water, with a darker, more textured background. There are six pelicans swimming, all facing opposite directions, creating a dynamic composition. The seabird that was previously present is no longer visible, and the pelicans appear larger and more detailed, with their white feathers and long beaks clearly defined against the darker water.', 'The final scene shows a white duck standing on grass, with two additional white birds of the same breed, all in a side pose.']
