ackground.', 'The vending machine now features two equal compartments, each containing white cuboidal objects. On the side, there are added colored leaflets, enhancing the visual appeal of the machine.', 'The dining area now features a smaller, more compact wooden table with a warm, earthy tone, surrounded by fewer white chairs. The table is adorned with potted plants, adding a touch of greenery. A decorative cupboard with a warm, wooden finish is positioned behind the table, enhancing the cozy ambiance. The perspective has shifted to a front angle, offering a clear view of the table and chairs. A large window in the background allows ample natural light to flood the space, creating a bright and inviting atmosphere.', 'The scene now features a soft drinks vending machine in place of the book shelves, with a human hand reaching out to it. The arrangement of items on the shelves has been removed, and the perspective has been adjusted to a close-up view, focusing on the vending machine and the hand.', 'The wolf is now lying down with its tail pointing down, its fur appearing more smooth and silky, and it is looking in the opposite direction from the original image. The background has been changed to include brown bushes, creating a more natural and earthy setting.', 'The refrigerator is now transformed into a wide, brown bookshelf filled with books and other items, with all shelves densely packed. A flatscreen TV is added to the top right corner, and the background features a beige wall.', 'The scene now features a flag perched atop the elephant in the mud, with people riding on animals. A colorful cloth drapes over the elephant, and water flows beneath it. In the background, a hill rises, adding depth to the setting.', 'The scene now depicts a snowy landscape with four dogs pulling a cart through the snow, with a narrowed viewpoint focusing on the dogs and the cart. The background features dry trees and a clear sky, contrasting with the previous snowy mountains.', 'The white dog is now walking on the grass with its mouth open, and a white furry dog is present in the background. The scene is shot from a front angle, with green vegetation visible in the background.']
