wo monkeys instead of a lion, with a pool of blue water in the foreground and a tree in front of it. The perspective has been changed to a distance angle, with trees visible in the background, creating a more expansive view of the setting.', "The scene now features a close-up of a wolf's face, with only one wolf visible, and a tree and vegetation in a blurry background.", 'The final scene shows a large, tightly packed roll of toilet paper in the foreground, with additional rolls of toilet paper and packed toilet paper in the background, far from the camera. The background is darker, creating a more subdued and focused view on the toilet paper.', 'The final scene shows a close-up view of a single white golf ball, with a minimalist box surrounding it. The box is simplified and stylized, with a clean, modern design. The background is removed, leaving only the white golf ball and the box in focus.', 'The scene now shows only one vending machine, which has been painted yellow. Two blue trash cans are placed next to it on the ground. In the background, a microwave has been added, and the vending machine is now surrounded by a clear sky.', 'The windows now show a different landscape, with the blinds covering half of each window. The rug has been removed from the room, and a chair has been added to the tiled floor.', 'The image now shows a corner view of a wall with safety pins and photo mounts, with the kettlebell dumbbells hanging on the wall in a portrait orientation. The box and table have been removed, and the scene is focused on the wall with the hanging objects.', 'The final scene shows a black TV with a white background, maintaining the original black screen and the green power indicator light.', 'The final scene shows a close-up view of the living room with the orange dinosaur removed, focusing on the remaining dinosaurs floating in the air. The window on the left side of the room is now visible, and a flower vase can be seen at the back of the room. The camera angle is straight forward, providing a clear view of the couch and the wall behind it.']
